  {
   "title": "Mapag- and pala-: doing it habitually",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "type": "p",
     "t": "The prefixes **mapag-** and **pala-**, attached to a root, describe the **habitual and frequent action** of the doer, as expressed by the root word."
    },
    {
     "type": "box",
     "kind": "rule",
     "title": "Mapag- or pala-?",
     "items": [
      "The two prefixes are **interchangeable**, except when attached to adjectives.",
      "**Pala-** only goes with **action** roots.",
      "**Mapag-** may go with both **action** and **describing** words.",
      "The resulting words are always **accented on the last syllable**: palatawá, mapag-arál."
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "table",
     "head": [
      "Root",
      "Pala- / mapag- word"
     ],
     "rows": [
      [
       "[[tawa|pred]]  laugh",
       "[[palatawá|pred]] or [[mapagtawá|pred]]  laughs frequently"
      ],
