   ],
   "answer": "having the quality of the root",
   "explain": "Magandá = beautiful (may ganda)."
  },
  {
   "type": "choice",
   "q": "Ma- + a concrete root (like bigás, rice) means…",
   "options": [
    "having many or much of it",
    "in favor of it",
    "used for it"
   ],
   "answer": "having many or much of it",
   "explain": "Mabigás = plenty of rice."
  },
  {
   "type": "choice",
   "q": "With ma-, a root that starts with d (like dúnong) changes the d to…",
   "options": [
